  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "你有没有发现，AI 给你的设计一眼就能看出是 AI 做的？",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 5288,
      "timestampMs": 0,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "紫色渐变、居中布局，千篇一律。这些都是 AI 默认的平均审美。",
      "startMs": 5288,
      "endMs": 10576,
      "timestampMs": 5288,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "装一个 Design Skill，就不一样了。",
      "startMs": 10576,
      "endMs": 14102,
      "timestampMs": 10576,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "大多数 AI 出图的问题不是技术，是没有设计语言。",
      "startMs": 14102,
      "endMs": 18802,
      "timestampMs": 14102,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "第一个，Impeccable。",
      "startMs": 18802,
      "endMs": 21740,
      "timestampMs": 18802,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "它把这些 AI 审美问题归纳成 37 条规则。",
      "startMs": 21740,
      "endMs": 25720,
      "timestampMs": 21740,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Visual Typography、Color、Layout 等 8 个类别。",
      "startMs": 25720,
      "endMs": 28203,
      "timestampMs": 25720,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "这些就是让人一眼认出 AI 出图的特征，紫色渐变、毛玻璃滥用。",
      "startMs": 28203,
      "endMs": 34079,
      "timestampMs": 28203,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "每一条都有名字和说明，它能实时检测设计里存在哪些反模式，并标注出来。",
      "startMs": 34079,
      "endMs": 40542,
      "timestampMs": 34079,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "左边是装上之后，右边是默认 AI 输出。同样的提示词，完全不同的结果。",
      "startMs": 40542,
      "endMs": 47005,
      "timestampMs": 40542,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "22,000 Star，是 AI 辅助设计必装的第一个 Skill。",
      "startMs": 47005,
      "endMs": 52881,
      "timestampMs": 47005,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "第二个，Skill Frontend Design。",
      "startMs": 52881,
      "endMs": 56994,
      "timestampMs": 52881,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "提供了六种鲜明的审美方向。",
      "startMs": 56994,
      "endMs": 58600,
      "timestampMs": 56994,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Swiss 极简。",
      "startMs": 58600,
      "endMs": 60200,
      "timestampMs": 58600,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Baltic 粗粝工业。",
      "startMs": 60200,
      "endMs": 61950,
      "timestampMs": 60200,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Nordic 克制。",
      "startMs": 61950,
      "endMs": 63200,
      "timestampMs": 61950,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Neo 赛博。",
      "startMs": 63200,
      "endMs": 64045,
      "timestampMs": 63200,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "不是让 AI 乱选风格，是让你主动锚定一种，AI 才能稳定输出有记忆点的界面。",
      "startMs": 64045,
      "endMs": 71096,
      "timestampMs": 64045,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "它内置了一份反模式清单，禁用 Inter 字体，禁用紫色渐变，禁用居中堆叠。",
      "startMs": 71096,
      "endMs": 77559,
      "timestampMs": 71096,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "让 AI 从源头规避这些设计雷区。左边是装上之后，右边是没有 Skill 的默认输出。",
      "startMs": 77559,
      "endMs": 84022,
      "timestampMs": 77559,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "同样一句提示词，两个完全不同的结果。",
      "startMs": 84022,
      "endMs": 88135,
      "timestampMs": 84022,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "第三个，UI UX PRO Max。",
      "startMs": 88135,
      "endMs": 91661,
      "timestampMs": 88135,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "把你每次设计时都要查的东西全部内置进去了。",
      "startMs": 91661,
      "endMs": 96361,
      "timestampMs": 91661,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "161 套按行业划分的配色方案。",
      "startMs": 96361,
      "endMs": 98270,
      "timestampMs": 96361,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "67 种 UI 风格定义。",
      "startMs": 98270,
      "endMs": 100180,
      "timestampMs": 98270,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "57 个字体搭配推荐。",
