      "endMs": 102090,
      "timestampMs": 100180,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "99 条 UX 指导原则。",
      "startMs": 102090,
      "endMs": 103999,
      "timestampMs": 102090,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "告诉它你在做什么产品，它直接给你一整套设计系统，颜色、字体、间距。",
      "startMs": 103999,
      "endMs": 108600,
      "timestampMs": 103999,
      "confidence": 1
    },
    {
